===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The act of writing again or anew.
#: {{ux|en|The film script underwent a '''rewrite''' for the European market.}}
# Something that has been written again.
# {{lb|en|math|computing}} The replacement of [[subterm]]s of a [[formula]] with other [[term]]s, according to certain [[rule]]s, by way of [[transformation]].

